message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software

title: "objectclassification"
abstract: >-
  Computer vision system for garbage classification and selection with a
  robotic arm. Combines convolutional neural network models for object
  recognition with inverse kinematics for manipulation, and includes a
  graphical interface for operation and real-time video inference.

